  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure one of Millwater's last remaining parcels of land and create a home truly your own. Design and build a home that reflects your lifestyle, in a place where you can put down roots, create memories and build a future.\r\n\r\nSet within an established and welcoming community, these lots enjoy convenient access to Silverdale Mall, Northern Arena Swimming Pool and schools such as KingsWay. With easy access to the Northern Motorway, commuting and travel to Auckland is made more convenient, while the nearby coastal township of Orewa offers beaches, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities close by.\r\n\r\nThe setting is equally special, with the river surrounding the land, views across the inland sea and distant sea views beyond. The combination of water, open outlook and natural surroundings creates a peaceful and distinctive setting in which to come home.\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity for developers and future homeowners alike to build and create their dream homes in one of North Auckland's increasingly limited land opportunities. \r\n\r\nThe title is to be issued approximately mid/late 2027.\r\n\r\nDon't hesitate to contact us for further information.",
